I have to tell you, and I honestly mean this from the bottom of my heart, this has been

00:48:17.480 --> 00:48:20.820
the best evening that I have ever spent in my life doing any kind of stuff.

00:48:20.820 --> 00:48:25.340
My darling Dolly, I feel the same.

00:48:25.340 --> 00:48:30.000
I'm just sure of one thing.

00:48:45.800 --> 00:48:50.700
Before we go through the roof, I think maybe we better say goodnight to all of these wonderful people.

00:48:50.960 --> 00:48:52.720
Thank you, and goodnight.

00:49:04.730 --> 00:49:08.430
Thirty minutes from now, CBS News will bring you a special report.

00:49:08.850 --> 00:49:10.070
Terror in Tehran.

00:49:10.450 --> 00:49:14.430
A look at the turbulence in Iran, including the attack on the American embassy.

00:49:15.010 --> 00:49:18.770
Charles Collingwood anchors this report one half hour from now.

00:49:18.770 --> 00:49:29.670
The announcer was played by Tony Lyons.

00:49:30.700 --> 00:49:32.200
was John Faulk.

00:49:32.200 --> 00:49:33.960
The preceding program was recorded

00:49:33.960 --> 00:49:35.990
before a live audience.
